  "bodyHash": "785d757c2d853a73",
  "content": "\n\n<p>本资源包将 Create 的旧版铜质纹理全部还原，包括脚手架、桌盖、所有流体物品、铜瓦以及更多！如果你认为新纹理不够理想，可以使用本包将所有铜质纹理更改回旧版！<br><br>目前支持的方块：<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 所有流体相关方块，例如流体管道<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_10367948-4d11-4a22-b47d-d056c36ae26a.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 所有铜质建筑方块，包括其氧化变种<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_42d7c03f-7da3-40b4-a6aa-5ee94311db86.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 含有少量铜元素的方块，例如库存链接和显示链接<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_2199746f-b447-459f-8006-aa72b91632ba.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 包含铜质纹理的新方块，例如桌盖或股票行情显示器<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_535a32c1-7d67-462c-b399-537bc0650d84.png\"><br><br>目前支持的物品：<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 所有方块对应的物品形态<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_8bf2bd6c-2804-4d5e-8d42-4c1ccb747d5e.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 新增的含铜物品，例如信号发射器<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_97d061bd-6321-47cd-b4be-43c0d8099fe7.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 所有与铜相关的物品，例如铜板<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_23f60fc3-db86-4a24-bc78-e13c2e4cfb61.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - 土豆炮<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210517/description_d09d3df0-af24-46a0-b41f-c8b1f3da5e82.png\"></p>\n<p>希望你能喜欢这个资源包！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>同时推荐查看：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-new-copper-stuffs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create：新铜制品</a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
